  "id": "inclusiveness",
  "term": "inclusiveness",
  "definition": "Inclusiveness is the extent to which a classroom environment supports inclusive education for all learners. In this context, it is reflected in teachers’ attitudes and can be described through views about inclusion philosophy, classroom practice, social inclusion, and support.",
